# co_window_4corner_a is a rare window piece.
# Four angled glass barriers frame the floor junction. This changes how the floor connects.
# Its tag and WEIGHT let the controller select it without a file list.
NAME:   co_window_4corner_a
WEIGHT: 3
TAGS:   transparent luniq allow_dup extra serial_co_window_rare
SUBST:  c : cm
MAP
xxxxxx@xxxxx@xxxxxx
xxxxxx.xxxxx.xxxxxx
@..xxx...x...xxx..@
xx.xxxxx.x.xxxxx.xx
xx.xxxxx.m.xxxxx.xx
xx.......c.......xx
xxxxxxxmcccmxxxxxxx
xx.......c.......xx
xx.xxxxx.m.xxxxx.xx
xx.xxxxx.x.xxxxx.xx
@..xx....x...xxx..@
xxxxx.xxxxxx.xxxxxx
xxxxx@xxxxxx@xxxxxx
ENDMAP
